<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-BANK SHARE INDICES DIP AFTER WEDNESDAY TRADE.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-BANK SHARE INDICES DIP AFTER WEDNESDAY TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial bank indices showed a slight fall after Wednesday's Latvia share trading.</p>
<p>RIETUMU INDEX FELL 0.56 PERCENT TO 228.85</p>
<p>RIETUMU16 INDEX FELL 0.5 PERCENT TO 227.7</p>
<p>SAULE10 INDEX FELL 0.57 PERCENT TO 199.23 A full market report will follow shortly</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
